<section class="grid2" aria-label="Context and flag">
  <div class="card">
    <h2 class="section-title">Context</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Mid-quarter</li>
      <li>18 active roles</li>
      <li>3 revenue-critical hires</li>
      <li>Weekly hiring manager sync already on the calendar</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="muted">
      Chief’s Monday Brief surfaces one structural risk:
      <strong>Enterprise Sales — pipeline coverage insufficient to meet offer target within the current time horizon.</strong>
      No dashboard scrolling. No speculation. Just flagged risk.
    </p>
  </div>

  <aside class="card">
    <h2 class="section-title">Flag</h2>

    <p class="muted">
      🚩 <strong>Inbound application volume trending below target</strong> over a 4-week window.
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>Stage conversions stable</li>
      <li>Offer acceptance stable</li>
      <li>Intake target unchanged</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="callout">
      This is not a quality issue. Not a calibration issue. <strong>It’s a supply problem.</strong>
    </div>
  </aside>
</section>

<section class="full" aria-label="What the system did automatically">
  <h2 class="section-title">What the system did automatically</h2>

  <p class="muted">
    Before the recruiter opens their laptop, Pipeline Health has:
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>Identified the issue in candidate application volume</li>
    <li>Estimated impact on hiring (intake shortfall and time horizon risk)</li>
    <li>Researched and eliminated confounding variables</li>
    <li>Determined root cause: <strong>supply constraint</strong></li>
  </ul>

  <div class="callout">
    Pipeline Health triggers Sourcing Agent and stages interventions.
    <strong>Nothing is sent automatically.</strong> Everything awaits human approval.
  </div>

  <div class="miniGrid miniGrid--4" aria-label="Staged interventions">
    <div class="mini">
      <b>Database outreach</b>
      <span>
        102 candidates identified · 55 newly eligible (no contact in 90 days) · draft message prepared
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="mini">
      <b>Referral promotion</b>
      <span>
        Slack-ready post · role summary + referral bonus reminder · social templates + direct link included
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="mini">
      <b>LinkedIn InMail campaign</b>
      <span>
        106 newly sourced candidates · 6 employee connections identified · suggested intro requests prepared
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="mini">
      <b>PPC campaign (guarded)</b>
      <span>
        Ad copy drafted · targeting defined · spend estimate + CPL forecast · manager approval if above threshold
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

